  "news": [
    {
      "title": "Dollar Rises on Surging Crude Prices and T-Note Yields",
      "title_zh": "原油价格和T-Note收益率飙升导致美元上涨",
      "summary": "The dollar index (DXY00 ) rose by +0.14% on Tuesday, just below Monday’s 1.5-week high.. Tuesday’s +4% surge in WTI crude oil prices raised inflation expectations and could persuade the Fed to tighten monetary policy, supporting the dollar.. Also, Tuesday’s increase in the 10-year T-note yield to a 19-year high...",
      "summary_zh": "美元指数（ DXY00 ）周二上涨+0.14% ，略低于周一的1.5周高点。周二WTI原油价格飙升+4% ，提高了通胀预期，并可能说服美联储收紧货币政策，支撑美元。此外，周二10年期国债收益率升至19年高点。",
      "analysis": "央行政策动向影响市场流动性预期和资产定价方向",
